#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Builds foundations of quantum computing, technology, and business applications."
msgstr "Construit les bases du calcul quantique, de la technologie et des applications commerciales."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Aperçu"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Aperçu {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Designed by IBM Quantum&reg; experts, this course covers the essentials of quantum computing and applications for business. Learn about this new computing paradigm, how it works, and its potential to address incredibly complex business problems. Complete the course to earn your IBM Quantum Business Foundations badge.\n"
msgstr "Conçu par des experts d'IBM Quantum&reg;, ce cours couvre les fondamentaux du calcul quantique et ses applications pour les entreprises. Découvre ce nouveau paradigme de calcul, son fonctionnement et son potentiel pour résoudre des problèmes métier d'une complexité extraordinaire. Termine le cours pour obtenir ton badge IBM Quantum Business Foundations.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Examen {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for Quantum business foundations, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training linked below. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. Once you have passed the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Pour obtenir ton badge Quantum Business Foundations, passe l'examen sur IBM&reg; Training via le lien ci-dessous. Cet examen est conçu pour être passé après avoir lu les leçons de ce cours. Une fois que tu auras réussi l'examen, tu seras notifié par Credly que tu as obtenu un badge.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Examen](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Awarded Badge {#awarded-badge}"
msgstr "Badge décerné {#awarded-badge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Image of the awarded badge\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![\"Image du badge décerné\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/badge.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credly {#credly}"
msgstr "Credly {#credly}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/). IBM employees can view the IBM Internal Privacy Statement [here](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice).\n"
msgstr "AVIS : IBM fait appel aux services de Credly, un sous-traitant tiers autorisé par IBM et situé aux États-Unis, pour faciliter l'administration du programme IBM Digital Badge. Afin de t'émettre un IBM Digital Badge, tes informations personnelles (nom, adresse e-mail et badge obtenu) seront partagées avec Credly. Tu recevras une notification par e-mail de Credly avec les instructions pour réclamer ton badge. Tes informations personnelles sont utilisées pour émettre ton badge ainsi qu'à des fins de reporting et d'exploitation du programme. IBM peut partager les informations personnelles collectées avec ses filiales et des tiers dans le monde entier. Elles seront traitées conformément aux pratiques de confidentialité d'IBM. La déclaration de confidentialité IBM peut être consultée [ici.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/) Les employés IBM peuvent consulter la déclaration de confidentialité interne IBM [ici.](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice)\n"
